  "id": "speech-and-language-therapy",
  "term": "speech and language therapy",
  "definition": "Speech and language therapy is a service that helps address the goals of people with aphasia, including better language use, fuller participation in everyday life, and support with adjustment and communication needs. Its purpose can include assessment, prevention, maintenance, enabling participation, rehabilitation, supportive care, and comfort.",
